sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator as Platform Orchestrator
    participant KubeAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Controller as WorkbenchesReconciler<br/>controller-runtime
    participant FS as /opt/manifests<br/>(filesystem)
    participant Operands as Operand Deployments

    Note over Orchestrator,Operands: Flow 1: Workbenches CR Reconciliation

    Orchestrator->>KubeAPI: Create/Update Workbenches CR<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    KubeAPI-->>Controller: Watch event (Workbenches CR changed)
    Controller->>FS: Read kustomize manifests<br/>(hermetic, no network)
    FS-->>Controller: Raw manifests
    Note over Controller: Overlay RELATED_IMAGE_* env vars<br/>Merge CR params (gatewayDomain,<br/>mlflowEnabled, platform)<br/>Select ODH/RHOAI overlay
    Controller->>KubeAPI: Server-Side Apply operand resources<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token<br/>Field manager: workbenches-operator
    KubeAPI-->>Controller: Apply result
    Controller->>KubeAPI: Watch operand Deployments<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    KubeAPI-->>Controller: Deployment status updates
    Note over Controller: Compute ModuleStatus phase<br/>(Pending/Initializing/Ready/<br/>Upgrading/Degraded/Failed)
    Controller->>KubeAPI: Update Workbenches CR status<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token

    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant WebhookSvc as Webhook Service<br/>443->9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HPWH as Hardware Profile Webhook
    participant CNWH as Connection Webhook

    Note over User,CNWH: Flow 2: Notebook Admission Webhook

    User->>KubeAPI: Create/Update Notebook CR
    KubeAPI->>WebhookSvc: POST /workbenches-hardware-profile<br/>Port: 443->9443/TCP<br/>Encryption: TLS (service-CA)<br/>Auth: TLS client cert
    WebhookSvc->>HPWH: Forward admission request
    HPWH->>KubeAPI: Read HardwareProfile CR<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    KubeAPI-->>HPWH: HardwareProfile spec
    Note over HPWH: Apply resource limits,<br/>nodeSelector, tolerations,<br/>Kueue LocalQueue label
    HPWH-->>WebhookSvc: Mutated admission response
    WebhookSvc-->>KubeAPI: JSON Patch response

    KubeAPI->>WebhookSvc: POST /workbenches-connection-notebook<br/>Port: 443->9443/TCP<br/>Encryption: TLS (service-CA)<br/>Auth: TLS client cert
    WebhookSvc->>CNWH: Forward admission request
    CNWH->>KubeAPI: SubjectAccessReview (verify secret access)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    KubeAPI-->>CNWH: SAR result
    Note over CNWH: Inject connection secrets<br/>as envFrom into Pod spec
    CNWH-->>WebhookSvc: Mutated admission response
    WebhookSvc-->>KubeAPI: JSON Patch response
    KubeAPI-->>User: Notebook CR created/updated
